<hr />
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5083 is an African American male, 21 years of age with dark black hair, and brown eyes. the SCP weighs 100&#160;kg and is 190&#160;cm tall, with the anomalous ability to produce electricity from the fingertips. The voltage can range from low to high, but the anomaly tends to express favoritism towards higher voltages, and can do so more easily after consuming red meat products. Due to the SCP's abilities, their memory and intelligence are superior to a typical human. Because of this, SCP-5083 has standard Mobile Task Force training, and is proficient with bladed weapons and firearms, but where SCP-5083 really shines is hand to hand combat. All of which is due to the encounters the SCP has had with MTF agents and foundation guards. The SCP can also produce blade like objects made of electricity that stems from the back of the hand and forms a thin point. The SCP also possesses a rage state that allows for the anomaly to produce an electromagnetic field that instantly terminates someone upon contact.</p>
